_site
.bundle

# ─── Block heavy media globally ───
*.mp4
# AI prototype media is intentional site content; allow future prototype folders too.
!assets/media/ai-prototypes/**/*.mp4
!assets/img/fairview/specialty-icons.mp4
# Case-study demo clips. These are referenced by the Marriott and M Health
# Fairview pages and are small (128K-356K, 1.5MB for all six). The blanket
# *.mp4 above meant they existed on every machine that made them and on no
# deploy: the pages worked locally and shipped six broken <video> elements to
# production, which is what the link checker had been failing on.
!assets/img/marriott/04-overview.mp4
!assets/img/marriott/05-flow.mp4
!assets/img/marriott/06-enroll.mp4
!assets/img/marriott/08-enrollmodal.mp4
!assets/img/fairview/07-choose.mp4
!assets/img/fairview/11-assistant.mp4
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.webm
*.glb
*.gltf
*.fbx
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# ─── Block assets/video by default, allow specific homepage/loader files ───
assets/video/*
!assets/video/cube_gettingup.mp4
!assets/video/loading-ani.mp4
!assets/video/sid_intro.mp4
!assets/video/sid_pixelated.mp4
!assets/video/sid_sitting.mp4
!assets/video/cube_footer.mp4
# ─── Play page scatter clips ───
!assets/video/play/
!assets/video/play/*.mp4
# The twelve short clips beside their own .jpg posters. The posters were
# tracked and the clips were not, so every one of them was a 404 on the
# deployed site while looking perfectly fine on the machine that made them —
# the same trap the note above this block describes.
!play/assets/video/
!play/assets/video/*.mp4

# ─── Allow 3D models in assets/models for the Enter scene floating sculpture ───
!assets/models/*.glb

# ─── Allow video/mov inside project asset folders ───
!1.met/**/*.mp4
!1.met/**/*.mov
# Specific re-ignore — webby.mov is a 72MB local-only file, not for the site
1.met/webby.mov
!2.cube/**/*.mp4
!2.cube/**/*.mov
!2.ai-self/**/*.mp4
!4.mandala/**/*.mp4
!4.mandala/**/*.mov
!5.bb/**/*.mp4
!5.mool/**/*.mp4
!6.mindu/**/*.mp4
!7.naavo/**/*.mp4
!8.shotoniphone/**/*.mp4
!9.aananda/**/*.mp4
!10.alpha/**/*.mp4
!11.illu/**/*.mp4
!15.bloom-vp/**/*.mp4

# ─── Allow play page assets (videos in masonry + spiral hero) ───
!play/assets/*.mp4
!play/assets/*.gif

